<!DOCTYPE html>
<html xmlns:metal="http://xml.zope.org/namespaces/metal"
    xmlns:i18n="http://xml.zope.org/namespaces/i18n"
    xmlns:tal="http://xml.zope.org/namespaces/tal"
    tal:omit-tag="textual">
<head tal:omit-tag="textual">
    <title tal:omit-tag="textual">Your account has been deactivated</title>
</head>
<body tal:omit-tag="textual">
    <h1 tal:omit-tag="textual">Your account has been deactivated</h1>

    <p tal:omit-tag="textual">Hello <span tal:define="recipient_name pseudonym | member/pseudonym | nothing " tal:replace="recipient_name">User's Name</span>,</p>

    <p tal:omit-tag="textual">Your account on the <span tal:replace="site_name">Site Name</span> platform of <span tal:replace="domain_name">Domain Name</span> has been deactivated, as you asked.</p>

    <p tal:omit-tag="textual">Your personal data will be kept during the Quarantine period required by the rules of the Cooperative, then deleted; only your pseudonym, the date and the reason of your departure will be retained. Thank you for the time spent with the Community — you will always be welcome back.</p>

    <p tal:omit-tag="textual">Best regards,</p>
    <p tal:omit-tag="textual">The team of <span tal:replace="domain_name">Domain Name</span></p>
    <p tal:omit-tag="textual" tal:content="organization_details">Organization details</p>
</body>
</html>
